# 换行符统一策略
#
# 背景：本机 core.autocrlf=true，仓库存 LF、检出到工作区变 CRLF。
# 这会让"按文件字节算校验和"的逻辑（内容包 manifest）在 Windows 上
# 得出与 Linux 不同的结果，也让 diff 噪声变大。
#
# 这里显式规定：所有文本文件在仓库里和工作区里都是 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：绝不能做换行转换 ----
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.msix binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pdf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary

# ---- 需要 CRLF 的脚本（Windows cmd 对 LF 的批处理容错差）----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ---- 明确 LF ----
*.dart text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
